# Cache strategy

Availability changes at different rates depending on status.

Implement configurable TTLs.

Suggested initial values:

```text
available:
    3-5 minutes

taken:
    1-6 hours

unknown:
    30-60 seconds

pricing:
    1-6 hours
```

Do not permanently cache availability.

Cache normalized results using:

```text
