# Normalization

Before checking availability:

* lowercase;
* strip spaces;
* Unicode normalize;
* convert IDNs correctly;
* remove illegal characters;
* enforce DNS label constraints;
* deduplicate;
* deduplicate case-insensitively;
* deduplicate candidates with identical normalized forms.

Reject impossible names before hitting availability APIs.

