# 3. Batch everything

This matters enormously more than Rust.

Bad:

```text
500 domains
=
500 HTTPS requests
```

Better:

```text
500 domains
=
3 × ~167-domain requests
```

or whatever the provider permits.

And run independent providers/batches concurrently when appropriate:

```text
batch A ──────────────┐
batch B ──────────────┼── results
batch C ──────────────┘
```

If each upstream takes 250 ms:

Sequential:

```text
250 + 250 + 250
≈ 750 ms
```

Parallel:

```text
max(250, 250, 250)
≈ 250 ms
```

Language choice can't recover that 500 ms.

